# Raw NICE cache is NEVER redistributed — see LICENSING.md §7.
# This file predates `git init` on purpose: without it, the first `git add -A`
# would commit mirrored NICE content and make a licence problem permanent.
data/raw/

# The built table carries verbatim NICE text (nice_comments_raw is full
# sentences), and the decision of 19 Aug 2026 is to redistribute no NICE
# content at all — the artefact is the pipeline, not the corpus. Rebuild it
# with `python -m hta.cli build`. Derived *statistics* live in results/ and
# are committed.
data/processed/

